    "info": {
      "name": "Bizim Riyaziyyat API",
      "description": "API collection for Bizim Riyaziyyat — covers Auth, Videos, News, Users, Teachers, Teacher-Test-Access, Payments endpoints. Updated 2026-09-23 (vercel.json diff): added route /api/payments → /api/payments/index.js. Payments support GET (list own or all for admin) and POST (record payment + update user balance). Updated 2026-09-22 (success.html diff): added 'Sınaq Balları' leaderboard tab (renderTestScores). No new REST endpoints were introduced — the change reads testScores from the userPoints Upstash/localStorage structure. awardTestPoints() in points.js must persist a testScores map (keyed by testId) containing {testId, testTitle, ballScore, date} for the new UI to display data. Points — Update User Points now includes the testScores payload shape.",
